      <VERS vnumber="8">And there went <gr str="3318">out </gr>the <gr str="4428">king </gr>of <gr str="5467">Sodom</gr>, and the <gr str="4428">king </gr>of <gr str="6017">Gomorrah</gr>, and the <gr str="4428">king </gr>of <gr str="126">Admah</gr>, and the <gr str="4428">king </gr>of <gr str="6636">Zeboiim</gr>, and the <gr str="4428">king </gr>of <gr str="1106">Bela </gr>(the <gr str="1931">same </gr>
