      <VERS vnumber="11">And they <gr str="3947">took </gr>all the <gr str="7399">goods </gr>of <gr str="5467">Sodom </gr>and <gr str="6017">Gomorrah</gr>, and all their <gr str="400">food</gr>, and went their <gr str="3212">way</gr>.</VERS>
