        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="15">And he <gr str="2505">divided </gr>his men against them, he and his <gr str="5650">servants</gr>, by <gr str="3915">night</gr>, and <gr str="5221">smote </gr>them, and <gr str="7291">pursued </gr>them to <gr str="2327">Hobah</gr>, which <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is</STYLE> on the left <gr str="8040">hand </gr>of <gr str="1834">Damascus</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="16">And he brought <gr str="7725">back </gr>all the <gr str="7399">goods</gr>, and also brought <gr str="7725">again </gr>his <gr str="251">brother </gr>
